        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "And because the whole Microsoft stack is connected, getting it into my team's hands is just as simple.\n\nI put it where people already work - Microsoft Teams, anywhere across M365, even third-party surfaces.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the deployment target and the connection into Microsoft Teams. Frame this as the move from builder tooling into an everyday work surface.",
      "screenshot": ""
    },
