      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "Here's the invoice agent, live in Teams.\n\nI can @mention it, ask about a specific invoice, or request a full analysis - and it answers with the exact reasoning and grounding we built.",
      "demo_actions": "Open Teams and run a short interaction with the invoice analysis agent. Mention the agent, ask an invoice question, and show the response.",
